# TaskTrack

A small command-line task tracker built with Node.js and Commander.

```sh
npm install
node index.js add "Buy groceries"
node index.js add "Submit report" --due 2026-11-20 --priority high
node index.js list
node index.js done 1
node index.js clear --done
```

Due dates must be valid `YYYY-MM-DD` dates. Priorities can be `low`, `medium`, or `high`; tasks are listed from highest to lowest priority, and overdue tasks are shown in red.
Use `node index.js clear --done` to remove completed tasks.

Run the unit tests with `npm test`. Tasks are stored in `tasks.json` in the project directory. Use `npm link` to install the `tasktrack` command globally from this checkout.
